seemingly impossible odds into bloody massacres. When the smoke clears, you’ll be the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/f9cee442623edad26352866285f6da4c.poster.avif?t=1787045360\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/f9cee442623edad26352866285f6da4c.webm?t=1787045360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/f9cee442623edad26352866285f6da4c.mp4?t=1787045360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/99e5df5beab400eb6281728683b14606.avif?t=1787045360\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy goons dressed in razor-sharp tailoring, casting their shadows in gaslit alleys against soot-stained walls. Go down the foggy, rainy streets of Birmingham in the 30s, brought to life with meticulous historical faithfulness to capture the look and feel of British gangster stories like Peaky Blinders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/875963b14f97d219cf0c6b4189a1d9cb.poster.avif?t=1787045360\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/875963b14f97d219cf0c6b4189a1d9cb.webm?t=1787045360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582120/extras/875963b14f97d219cf0c6b4189a1d9cb.mp4?t=1787045360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p 